    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dante's 9 is a roguelite action-platformer fused with a deckbuilder, where you use powerful cards to augment your combat abilities. You are Dante the cat, and you must sacrifice your nine lives on your journey through the depths of the underworld. Can you reach the 9th circle before its too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.poster.avif?t=1749000684\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.webm?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.mp4?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a uniquely powerful deck each run to slay the monsters of the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.poster.avif?t=1749000684\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.webm?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.mp4?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the nine circles of Hell with real-time card-based combat, combined with action platforming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/3ae944a1205f08fd4d852e7d0fbeabe0.poster.avif?t=1749000684\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/3ae944a1205f08fd4d852e7d0fbeabe0.webm?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/3ae944a1205f08fd4d852e7d0fbeabe0.mp4?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse nine hellish environments and conquer unique challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable deckbuilding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique boss cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta-progression between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Unique biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meow button</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dante's 9 is a roguelite action-platformer fused with a deckbuilder, where you use powerful cards to augment your combat abilities. You are Dante the cat, and you must sacrifice your nine lives on your journey through the depths of the underworld. Can you reach the 9th circle before its too late?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deckbuilding</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.poster.avif?t=1749000684\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.webm?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/7c2e8210f3754c311ef88bcbb3f64ee7.mp4?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a uniquely powerful deck each run to slay the monsters of the underworld!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.poster.avif?t=1749000684\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.webm?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3293350/extras/522982b83464117af5afca66860bba76.mp4?t=1749000684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through the nine circles of Hell with real-time card-based combat, combined with action platforming!</p